            "review_title": "Review at Phieu Tinh Tien",
            "review_text": "Rob B\nAuckland, New Zealand7 contributions\n0\nPoor dining experience\nOct 2026 • Family\nWe went to this restaurant 2 weeks ago. The main restaurant is up a steep set of stairs, so be warned. The restaurant was not busy , probably 2 tables. The food tasted reasonable, but the portions were very small. The service was attentive. At the end of the meal, the stafff approached the 2 female guests and asked them to fill in an evaluation form for the restaurant. They would not leave until such time as the guests had filled in the form. I went to pay the acccount, only to then find that they did not accept card payement. There was no information posted anywhere stating this. My son had to go to an ATM to get funds to pay the account. All in all, it was not a good experience. The staff waiting for you to write a review and the fact that they would not accepts card payement. I will not return. Be warned , it is not worth th rating that the restaurant displays.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
